      "side": 1,
      "message": "This CL handles the comment https://dawn-review.googlesource.com/c/dawn/+/237554/comment/c07161a3_5673a313/. Please take a look, thanks!\n\nNote that as described in the issue 411268750, current CTS depth-stencil failures (without workaround) on Qualcomm devices includes both `depth24plus-stencil8` and `depth32float-stencil8` format, and I believe these two formats\u0027 failures reflect the same driver issue since (without this workaround) `depth24plus-stencil8` use the same underlying depth-stencil format `DXGI_FORMAT_D32_FLOAT_S8X24_UINT` as `depth32float-stencil8`.\nThis workaround only fixes the failure of `depth24plus-stencil8` by making it use `DXGI_FORMAT_D24_UNORM_S8_UINT` instead, so the potential driver issue should still get caught by CTS on `depth32float-stencil8` format.",
